{'symbol': 'CPB', 'date': '2019-11-20 22:30:00', 'title': 'CAMPBELL SOUP COMPANY DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON JANUARY 27, 2020', 'text': 'CAMPBELL SOUP COMPANY DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON CAMPBELL’S CAPITAL STOCK OF $0.35 PER SHARE. THE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JANUARY 27, 2020 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS JANUARY 8, 2020.'}